  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "學術報告導論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO ACADEMIC REPORTS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程內容在於提供學生瞭解學術論文的要件和類型，指引作業報告的前置規畫、撰寫文章、畢業論文甚至是會議論文。目的是培養學生進行文獻探討、正確地引用文獻、正確安排論文章節，以及與指導老師溝通等技能。學生就現有即將要提交作業報告於課堂中討論。這一門課程適合準備攻讀研究所的學生，另外對於計劃出國留學的學生而言，這門課程也是必不可少的，因為這些技能通常是整體書面審查評估的要點。",
    "describe_eh": "This course teaches students about all the necessary components and different types of academic papers. It introduces how to prepare a proposal, write an article, graduation thesis, and even a conference paper. The aim is to attain skills such as conducting literature review, citing properly, correctly phasing an article, and communicating with a supervisor. Existing articles and thesis will be discussed. Students are going to come up with and present their own academic paper proposals. This is an EMI course suitable for students wanting to pursue graduate studies. It is also essential for all those planning to study abroad because these skills are generally part of the overall assessment.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "學生具備溝通技巧\r\n",
      "describe_en": "Students are able to be effective communicators.\r\n"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "學生具備跨領域及商業問題解決能力",
      "describe_en": "Students possess interdisciplinary capabilities and problem-solving skills, supported by appropriate analytical techniques in business."
    }
